62	/* --- Block header (BASED template) ---
63	 * Each block in the heap, free or allocated, has a 6-byte header.
64	 *   BLOCK_SIZE = total bytes (header + user data)
65	 *   BLOCK_NEXT = next free block address (when free), or
66	 *                _PLSW_ALLOC_MAGIC (when allocated) */
